# Known false positives of tools/guard/scan.mjs: `<path glob> <rule> [sha256:<hex>]`. A hash pins the exact content.
# App icon, generated from build/icon.svg by scripts/make-icon.cjs: 10 PNG images (16-256 px), chunks IHDR/IDAT/IEND
# only, no text or metadata (checked 2026-10-11). A new icon blocks the sync until someone checks it and ADDS a line
# with its hash; never remove an old line: the public history keeps the old icon and the history scan checks it.
